        "tag": "Repair or replace",
        "heading": "Fix the chip before it spreads.",
        "highlight": "before it spreads.",
        "text": "A small chip in a windshield can often be repaired instead of replaced, which keeps the original glass in the vehicle. A chip can grow into a crack, so it is worth looking at soon. Geaux Auto Glass repairs minor chips on cars, SUVs and trucks, at your home or work or in our shops in Lafayette and Kenner. Tell us where the chip is and how big it looks when you request a quote, and we will tell you whether it can be repaired or needs a new windshield.",
